@startuml
title ActivationRequest - Hybrid outcome and retention (REVIEW)
[*] --> PROCESSING : authenticated valid request
PROCESSING --> SUCCEEDED : allocation + Subscriber + MAIN committed
PROCESSING --> FAILED : business failure / selected number unavailable
PROCESSING --> WAITING : automatic empty pool + explicit consent
WAITING --> SUCCEEDED : FIFO allocation before deadline\ncomplete consistent result
WAITING --> EXPIRED : deadline reached
WAITING --> FAILED : final invalid business conditions
SUCCEEDED --> Tombstone : full result retention7days elapsed
FAILED --> Tombstone : full result retention7days elapsed
EXPIRED --> Tombstone : full result retention7days elapsed
note right of WAITING
 Max24h from original waitingSince.
 Stock signal and DB recovery60s.
 Retry/restart never resets deadline.
 No Subscriber/Account success yet.
end note
note bottom of Tombstone
 Retains request scope + fingerprint + outcome summary.
 Old ID cannot create a new effect; payload mismatch conflicts.
 Never purge PROCESSING/WAITING as result retention.
end note
@enduml
